 adsorption</article-title><source>J. Am. Chem. Soc</source><year>1997</year><volume>119</volume><fpage>2224</fpage><lpage>2231</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="b7-ijms-10-01950"><label>7.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ariga</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Hill</surname><given-names>JP</given-names></name><name><surname>Ji</surname><given-names>Q</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Layer-by-layer assembly as a versatile bottom-up nanofabrication technique for exploratory research and realistic application</article-title><source>Phys. Chem. Chem. Phys</source><year>2007</year><volume>9</volume><fpage>2319</fpage><lpage>2340</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17492095</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b8-ijms-10-01950"><label>8.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ji</surname><given-names>Q</given-names></name><name><surname>Miyahara</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Hill</surname><given-names>JP</given-names></name><name><surname>Acharya</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Vinu</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Yoon</surname><given-names>SB</given-names></name><name><surname>Yu</surname><given-names>JS</given-names></name><name><surname>Sakamoto</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Ariga</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Stimuli-free auto-modulated material release from mesoporous nano-compartment films</article-title><source>J. Am. Chem. Soc</source><year>2008</year><volume>130</volume><fpage>2376</fpage><lpage>2377</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18251466</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b9-ijms-10-01950"><label>9.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ariga</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Vinu</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Ji</surname><given-names>Q</given-names></name><name><surname>Ohmori</surname><given-names>O</given-names></name><name><surname>Hill</surname><given-names>JP</given-names></name><name><surname>Acharya</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Koike</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Shiratori</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A layered mesoporous carbon sensor based on nanopore-filling cooperative adsorption in the liquid phase</article-title><source>Angew. Chem. Int. Ed</source><year>2008</year><volume>47</volume><fpage>7254</fpage><lpage>7257</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="b10-ijms-10-01950"><label>10.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ariga</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Hill</surname><given-names>JP</given-names></name><name><surname>Ji</surname><given-names>Q</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Biomaterials and biofunctionality in layered macromolecular assemblies</article-title><source>Macromol. Biosci</source><year>2008</year><volume>8</volume><fpage>981</fpage><lpage>990</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18615874</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b11-ijms-10-01950"><label>11.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Mateos-Timoneda</surname><given-names>MA</given-names></name><name><surname>Crego-Calama</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Reinhoudt</surname><given-names>DN</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Supramolecular chirality of self-assembled systems in solution</article-title><source>Chem. Soc. Rev</source><year>2004</year><volume>33</volume><fpage>363</fpage><lpage>372</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15280969</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b12-ijms-10-01950"><label>12.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ajayaghosh</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Chithra</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Varghese</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Self-assembly of tripodal squaraines: Cation-assisted expression of molecular chirality and change from spherical to helical morphology</article-title><source>Angew. Chem. Int. Ed</source><year>2007</year><volume>46</volume><fpage>230</fpage><lpage>233</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="b13-ijms-10-01950"><label>13.</label><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lehn</surname><given-names>JM</given-names></name></person-group><source>Supramolecular Chemistry Concepts and Perspectives</source><publisher-name>Wiley-VCH</publisher-name><publisher-loc>Weinheim</publisher-loc><year>1995</year></citation></ref><ref id="b14-ijms-10-01950"><label>14.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Arunkumar</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Chithra</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Ajayaghosh</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A controlled supramolecular approach toward cation-specific chemosensors: Alkaline earth metal ion-driven exciton signaling in squaraine tethered podands</article-title><source>J. Am. Chem. Soc</source><year>2004</year><volume>126</volume><fpage>6590</fpage><lpage>6598</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15161287</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b15-ijms-10-01950"><label>15.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Franke</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Vos</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Antonietti</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Sommerdijk</surname><g